This is Splice, a Next.js 14 (App Router) + MongoDB (Mongoose) + Tailwind CSS
swipe-matching app for MedTechPreneurs ("Tinder for Co-Founders" in Indian
healthcare/MedTech). Full spec — data models, API routes, brand tokens, and
the build phase plan — lives in SPLICE_DEV_REFERENCE.md at the project root.
Read that file before implementing anything. Follow the phase order defined
there (Scaffold → Auth/Onboarding → Profile/Verification → Discovery/Swipe →
Matching Algorithm → Match/Chat → Toolkit → Polish/Deploy) — do not build
ahead of the phase I explicitly ask for.
